and analyzing protein folding trajectories</article-title><source>Algorithms for Molecular Biology</source><year>2007</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>3</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17407611</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>